  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/97abbbcc-77b9-4dc2-a1a8-dce9a9e1fac4-9895313.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 288px;\" /></p><ul>\t<li>Two lone pair one oxygen</li>\t<li>Molecule is &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>&#39; shaped(Due to lone pair)</li>\t<li>Bond angle is less than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>104</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>102</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>(Due to lone pair)</li>\t<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#183;</mo></math> of &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&#39; is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>(Fluorine is more electronegative than oxygen)</li></ul>",
